sts","summary":"本文说明如何把一套在自管理容器上运行的多模型 AI Agent 迁移到 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的托管运行时，保留原有业务逻辑并利用平台提供的伸缩、身份和可观测能力。","title":"Migrating multi-model AI agents to Amazon Bedrock AgentCore runtime"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_deb87cdd51a8b0ba0abfeb62a7a7c677e8f90cf2c8262f7030a4120592f3c6c4","internal_url":"/posts/20260919-blogs_podcasts-the-new-agentcore-runtime-elastic-optimized-and-co-0-b81a99111a/","observation_id":"obs_b81a99111a5a86711c99d41ed073572ee8ddebce77cc7e3eead3a07ff5c3a222","published_at":"2026-09-18T15:31:34Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一套面向构建和运行 AI 代理的托管计算层，旨在通过在会话结束后立即释放不再使用的内存，并保持容器启动时间不受并发量或镜像大小的影响，实现弹性、优化的运行时性能。","title":"The new AgentCore runtime: Elastic, optimized, and consistently fast starts"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:大语言模型","id":"tag:大语言模型","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":66,"graph_node_id":"tag:AI Agent","id":"tag:AI Agent","jaccard":0.442953,"topic":"AI Agent"},{"cooccurrence":37,"graph_node_id":"tag:Prompt 工程","id":"tag:Prompt 工程","jaccard":0.248322,"topic":"Prompt 工程"},{"cooccurrence":29,"graph_node_id":"tag:生成式 AI","id":"tag:生成式 AI","jaccard":0.194631,"topic":"生成式 AI"},{"cooccurrence":18,"graph_node_id":"tag:Announcements","id":"tag:Announcements","jaccard":0.120805,"topic":"Announcements"},{"cooccurrence":17,"graph_node_id":"tag:机器学习","id":"tag:机器学习","jaccard":0.114094,"topic":"机器学习"},{"cooccurrence":15,"graph_node_id":"tag:Advanced (300)","id":"tag:Advanced (300)","jaccard":0.100671,"topic":"Advanced (300)"},{"cooccurrence":13,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock AgentCore","id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock AgentCore","jaccard":0.087248,"topic":"Amazon Bedrock AgentCore"},{"cooccurrence":11,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock","id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock","jaccard":0.073826,"topic":"Amazon Bedrock"},{"cooccurrence":11,"graph_node_id":"tag:RAG","id":"tag:RAG","jaccard":0.073826,"topic":"RAG"},{"cooccurrence":8,"graph_node_id":"tag:Technical How-to","id":"tag:Technical How-to","jaccard":0.